      ],
      "text": "A creature who takes damage from the benthic reaver's eye beam Strike must succeed at a DC 41 Fortitude save save or become Slowed 2 as cold stiffens its limbs. A flying creature who fails its save also descends safely to the ground below. This is forced movement."
