        "emotion",
        "fear",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "The benthic reaver unleashes a cry of mourning. All creatures within 60 feet must attempt a DC 41 Will save save to resist. The benthic reaver can't use Song of the Lost for 1d4 rounds.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature is Frightened 1.\n\nFailure The creature is Frightened 2.\n\nCritical Failure As failure, but the creature is also Stunned 1 with sympathy."
